# UI/UX Guidelines

## Theme Application
- Must use `Theme.of(context)` to apply themes
- Theme files:
  - `theme/mobile/app_dark_theme.dart`
  - `theme/mobile/app_light_theme.dart`
  - `theme/mobile/app_color.dart`
- Add new colors to `app_color.dart`, do not modify existing colors

## Component Guidelines
- Create reusable components
- Use appropriate component composition
- Implement error state handling
- Handle loading states

## Responsive Design
- Use MediaQuery for responsive layouts
- Implement appropriate breakpoints
- Handle different screen sizes
- Support both portrait and landscape orientations

## Accessibility
- Use semantic labels
- Implement appropriate contrast ratios
- Support screen readers
- Handle different text sizes

## Best Practices
- Maintain consistent visual style
- Use appropriate spacing and padding
- Implement smooth animations
- Ensure good user experience





